<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.petname.accepts ~ a proposal lands as a pet name

`lares sensorium accept-name <sensorium> <proposal-id>` accepts one proposed pet name. A proposal id that stands nowhere answers exit 3.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ accept

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`accept` params=`sensorium/memory proposal-id/p-3 ~ accept a proposal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ sensorium · proposal-id

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`sensorium` params=`takes/name needs/required seat/1 as/<sensorium> ~ a named sensorium standing on this house`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`proposal-id` params=`takes/id needs/required seat/2 as/<proposal-id> ~ the proposal accepted`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ works this host's scratch sensoria under the cache; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[sense.petname.accepts sensorium/memory proposal-id/p-3]] ~ name a standing sensorium and a proposal id`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ accepted · absent

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`accepted` params=`exit/0 ~ the pet name landed`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`absent` params=`exit/3 ~ no proposal of that id`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

